{
  "profile": "work-linux",
  "os": "Linux",
  "shell": "/bin/bash",
  "why": "两台开发机共用。第一优先是修命令入口（~/.local/bin 对非交互 SSH 可见），不是装软件。",
  "hosts": {
    "dev8c": {
      "match_hostname": "n37-006-089"
    },
    "dev32c": {
      "match_hostname": "n37-068-191"
    }
  },
  "user_bin_dirs": [
    "~/.local/bin"
  ],
  "clients": {
    "claude": {
      "hook_files": [
        "~/.claude/settings.json"
      ],
      "skills_dir": "~/.claude/skills",
      "discovery_dirs": [
        "~/.claude/skills"
      ]
    },
    "codex": {
      "hook_files": [
        "~/.codex/config.toml",
        "~/.codex/hooks.json"
      ],
      "skills_dir": "~/.codex/skills",
      "discovery_cmd": "python3 skills_discovery.py codex"
    },
    "shared": {
      "skills_dir": "~/.agents/skills"
    },
    "trae": {
      "hook_files": [
        "~/.trae/traecli.toml"
      ],
      "skills_dir": "~/.trae/skills",
      "discovery_cmd": "python3 skills_discovery.py traecli"
    }
  },
  "skill_notes": [
    "重叠但功能有区别，本轮不删任何项、不按名称批量合并：grilling=访谈原语 / grill-me=无状态入口 / grill-with-docs=会落盘入口；handoff=写交接文件 / claude-handoff=会起后台 Claude。这些由上游安装器维护，本仓不纳管、不复制正文。",
    "除受管的 steelman-grill 外，~/.trae/skills 下的项一律保持现状：只做发现检查（断链 / frontmatter / name 一致性），不删不改。"
  ],
  "hook_notes": [
    "~/.codex/config.toml 里 `# dev-tracker:l1-hook BEGIN/END` 包住的 UserPromptSubmit 由 dev-tracker 的 sync-rules.sh 分发，owner 不是本仓：只报告，不改正文。比较时 ~/.trae/l1/<hash>/ 的 hash 段已被归一化。"
  ],
  "path_line_reports": [
    {
      "file": "~/.bashrc",
      "pattern": "\\.local/bin",
      "why": "对照守卫（case $- in）位置看这些行是否真的会执行；守卫之后的行只对交互 shell 生效"
    }
  ],
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "path-user-local-bin",
      "type": "config_block",
      "path": "~/.bashrc",
      "comment_prefix": "#",
      "insert_before_re": "^case \\$- in",
      "why": "~/.bashrc 的非交互 early-return 守卫（case $- in ... *) return）出现在原有 ~/.local/bin 导出之前，导致 ssh host 'cmd' 里这些导出永不执行；而 ~/.bash_profile 存在又让 ~/.profile 的 PATH 永远不被读取。所以修复点只能是 ~/.bashrc 且必须在守卫之前。",
      "body": [
        "# 受管块：让 ~/.local/bin 对登录 shell 与非交互 SSH 命令都可见。",
        "# 自带幂等守卫，重复应用不会堆出重复 PATH 段。",
        "case \":$PATH:\" in",
        "  *\":$HOME/.local/bin:\"*) ;;",
        "  *) PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\" ;;",
        "esac",
        "export PATH"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "codex",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "codex",
      "owner": "local-user-install",
      "required": true,
      "version_cmd": "codex --version",
      "version_re": "([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^codex-cli ",
      "install_cmd": "set -o pipefail; curl -fsSL --max-time 30 https://chatgpt.com/codex/install.sh | CODEX_NON_INTERACTIVE=1 sh",
      "update_cmd": "codex update",
      "note": "两台现有机器的 codex 都是 standalone 布局。缺失时使用经隔离容器验证的官方 standalone 安装脚本；安装器会写入 ~/.codex/packages/standalone 和 shell profile。受限网络须预先配置 HTTPS_PROXY；Docker daemon 的代理不会自动传给 shell。现有安装不迁移渠道，更新仍用 codex update。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uv",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "uv",
      "owner": "local-user-install",
      "required": true,
      "version_cmd": "uv --version",
      "version_re": "([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^uv [0-9]",
      "min_version": "0.8.0",
      "install_cmd": "set -o pipefail; curl -fsSL https://astral.sh/uv/0.12.18/install.sh | UV_INSTALL_DIR=\"$HOME/.local/bin\" UV_NO_MODIFY_PATH=1 sh",
      "update_cmd": "if readlink -f \"$(command -v uv)\" | grep -q '/pipx/venvs/'; then pipx upgrade uv; else uv self update; fi",
      "note": "现有两台机器的 uv 安装渠道不同：一台是 standalone，另一台是 pipx。缺失时只用经隔离容器验证的固定版 standalone 安装；已安装时不迁移渠道。update_cmd 先认渠道再更新：pipx venv 走 pipx upgrade uv，standalone 走 uv self update。"
    },
    {
      "id": "rg",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "rg",
      "owner": "trae-cli-installer-or-upstream-release",
      "required": true,
      "version_cmd": "rg --version",
      "version_re": "ripgrep ([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^ripgrep ",
      "install_cmd": "test \"$(uname -m)\" = x86_64 || { echo 'ripgrep installer supports x86_64 only'; exit 1; }; tmp=$(mktemp -d) || exit 1; trap 'rm -r \"$tmp\"' EXIT; cd \"$tmp\" || exit 1; curl -fsSL --max-time 60 -O https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/releases/download/15.2.0/ripgrep-15.2.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz && curl -fsSL --max-time 30 -O https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/releases/download/15.2.0/ripgrep-15.2.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256 && sha256sum -c ripgrep-15.2.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256 && tar -xzf ripgrep-15.2.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz && install -D -m 0755 ripgrep-15.2.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/rg \"$HOME/.local/bin/rg\"",
      "note": "现有两台机器的 rg 由 Trae CLI 安装器投放，缺失时才使用已在隔离容器验证的 upstream 15.2.0 x86_64 release 与 SHA-256 校验，不改已有文件。受限网络须预先配置 HTTPS_PROXY；不要求 sudo，不用旧版 apt 包。"
    },
    {
      "id": "git",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "git",
      "owner": "os-package",
      "required": true,
      "version_cmd": "git --version",
      "version_re": "git version ([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^git version"
    },
    {
      "id": "python3",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "python3",
      "owner": "os-package",
      "required": true,
      "version_cmd": "python3 --version",
      "version_re": "Python ([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^Python 3\\.",
      "note": "系统 Python 保留（实测 3.11.2）；项目用的 Python 由 uv 提供。"
    },
    {
      "id": "gh-github-cli",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "/usr/bin/gh",
      "explicit_path": true,
      "owner": "os-package",
      "required": false,
      "version_cmd": "/usr/bin/gh --version",
      "version_re": "gh version ([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^gh version",
      "note": "真 GitHub CLI（dev8c 实测 2.87.3，dev32c 没有）。/usr/local/bin/gh 是内部主机查询工具且在 PATH 里先命中：不改优先级、不卸载、不 alias；调用 GitHub CLI 时显式使用 /usr/bin/gh。"
    },
    {
      "id": "gh-internal",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "/usr/local/bin/gh",
      "explicit_path": true,
      "owner": "internal-host-tool",
      "required": false,
      "version_cmd": "/usr/local/bin/gh --version",
      "identity_re": "gh \\[target",
      "note": "内部主机查询工具，不认 --version（会报 unknown flag 并打 usage）。它与 gh-github-cli 两个组件并存本身就是 `gh` 的身份断言。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pnpm",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "pnpm",
      "owner": "nvm-node",
      "required": false,
      "version_cmd": "pnpm --version",
      "version_re": "([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+",
      "note": "dev8c 有 9.0.0（nvm 目录内），dev32c 没有。不因为另一台有就装 —— 等有项目需要再说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tmux",
      "type": "tool",
      "bin": "tmux",
      "owner": "os-package",
      "required": false,
      "version_cmd": "tmux -V",
      "version_re": "tmux ([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "identity_re": "^tmux [0-9]",
      "note": "dev32c 有 tmux 且有 8 个在途 bmx-* 会话（一律保留，不按存活时间清理）；dev8c 没有 tmux，也不装。"
    },
    {
